      "aspects": [
        "semi-square"
      ],
      "quote": "This causes social, domestic, and family trouble.\n\nThere is sorrow through friends and the affections, and some source of grief or disappointment will occur.\n\nSome financial loss or necessity for free expenditure is likely to arise.\n\nPleasures and amusements will not prosper and may be a source of anxiety."
